---
permalink: /_redirects
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
excludeFromSitemap: true
---
{#- Static (exact-path) redirects must come before any wildcard rule: Cloudflare
    counts every rule after the first wildcard as "dynamic", and those are
    capped at 100 per file. -#}
{%- for page in collections.all -%}
{%- if page.url and page.data.redirectFrom -%}
{%- for oldUrl in page.data.redirectFrom %}
{{ oldUrl }} {{ page.url }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{# Blog was renamed to News; catch the listing, its pagination, and every individual post. #}
/blog/*  /news/:splat  301
